# Git Sync Before Work

Before implementing any task, run:

```bash
scripts/sync_with_origin_main.sh --check
```

If the script reports that syncing is safe and the task has not started, run:

```bash
scripts/sync_with_origin_main.sh --sync
```

Stop and report if the script stops because of dirty work, divergence, conflicts, missing origin/main, or shared-branch risk.

Never run:

```bash
git reset --hard
git clean -fd
git push --force
git pull --rebase
```

unless explicitly approved by the user.
